Analysis: identify all conditions and the evaluation sequence. Condition 1 <code>GGPA &gt;= 3.60</code>, condition 2 <code>&gt;= 3.00</code> (only checked when condition 1 is False, so only the lower limit is needed), condition 3 <code>&gt;= 2.40</code>, condition 4 <code>&gt;= 1.70</code>, else Pass.
<pre>ggpa = float(input())
