The same logic can be written as <b>nested if…else</b> starting from <code>ggpa &gt;= 1.70</code> and going up. Both have similar structures, but <b>since indentation must be well-structured in Python, errors are more likely to occur in the deeply nested version</b>, so if…elif is preferred.

